{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been burned to ashes, and among the ruins, only the rebels continue to fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cinderia</strong>, a dark fairytale rogue-lite action game filled with blazing speed and defiant will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch\u2019s embers still smolder, and the whispers of her magic never fade. She never foresaw that her power would be seized by you and forged into a weapon. Daggers slice through darkness, cannons shatter foes, and frost halts death itself. Your combat style is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world turned to ash, fate brought them together. Now there is only one goal: to end the nightmare and make destiny obey their will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the desolate corners of the world, a warm flame still awaits you. Falling, bleeding, and failing are merely parts of the journey. Return, recover, and set out once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes an action roguelite truly fun? The thrill of precise, satisfying strikes or the explosive synergy of creative builds? Why choose? Master both. Chain skills into deadly art, but remember to dodge every attack. Only survival keeps the performance alive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214610?t=1760897531","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214610?t=1760897531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/a42b59b7385b3b4e08b8cf9fed402c2276af7e70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760897531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/a42b59b7385b3b4e08b8cf9fed402c2276af7e70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760897531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>\u200bCinderia: Where Fairy Tales Burn to Ash</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2.5D action roguelite where combos and skills collide as you command!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been burned to ashes, and among the ruins, only the rebels continue to fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cinderia</strong>, a dark fairytale rogue-lite action game filled with blazing speed and defiant will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch\u2019s embers still smolder, and the whispers of her magic never fade. She never foresaw that her power would be seized by you and forged into a weapon. Daggers slice through darkness, cannons shatter foes, and frost halts death itself. Your combat style is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world turned to ash, fate brought them together. Now there is only one goal: to end the nightmare and make destiny obey their will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the desolate corners of the world, a warm flame still awaits you. Falling, bleeding, and failing are merely parts of the journey. Return, recover, and set out once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.poster.avif?t=1760897531\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.webm?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.mp4?t=1760897531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes an action roguelite truly fun? The thrill of precise, satisfying strikes or the explosive synergy of creative builds? Why choose? Master both. Chain skills into deadly art, but remember to dodge every attack. Only survival keeps the performance alive.</p>","developers":["MyACG Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/db6b42f08dca140e2553f7afc66ba48821ef18e9/header.jpg?t=1760897531","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1336958344/9f9cf5e5b9c8c73c2c927d1160b36540a2320393/1760449315/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760450499","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1336958344/9f9cf5e5b9c8c73c2c927d1160b36540a2320393/1760449315/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760450499","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1336958344/9f9cf5e5b9c8c73c2c927d1160b36540a2320393/1760449315/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760450499","id":257217727,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217727/movie480.mp4?t=1760450499","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217727/movie_max.mp4?t=1760450499"},"name":"Cinderia PV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257217727/bb34d342faa6eb8f35f527d290506ed371cfca5e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760450499","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217727/movie480.webm?t=1760450499","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217727/movie_max.webm?t=1760450499"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1382231774/4950df3958379f1500303ede75d016d419bb4e82/1758862331/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758872686","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1382231774/4950df39583