lls, combos, passives, and equipment\u2014to create your own distinct fighting style. Darkness has swallowed the land, yet a faint glimmer still flickers among the ruins.","steam_appid":3214610,"support_info":{"email":"shinonomeshizuka@npcent.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}